## Next: v4.1 Stable

Before v4.1 Stable can be released, the following must be validated:

- [ ] Graph integrity: All 41 nodes valid, all edges reference existing nodes, no cycles in phase flow
- [ ] Detector routing: D1–D8 chain correctly; all fire in LISTEN phase
- [ ] Gate sequencing: L37 (WAIT) → L5 (ACT) → L41 (ACK) verified
- [ ] Safety layer activation: HSM triggers correctly on D3 or D5 signals
- [ ] Failure mode coverage: All FM#29-#45 have detection/recovery paths
- [ ] Backward compatibility: v4.1-RC output is indistinguishable from v4.0 on standard scenarios

See `IMPLEMENTATION_CHECKLIST.md` for detailed validation protocol.

